{"id":"vod_sn_38945","vodId":"38945","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"天降之物F","name_cn":"天降之物F","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/760c4901bc733e400be70348c9618641.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《天降之物f》改编自日本漫画家水无月嵩原作的漫画《天降之物》，亦是电视动画《天降之物》的第2期。《天降之物》故事以和平至上为座右铭的主角樱井智树为中心，他总是梦到一个想不起长相的女孩，直到有天从天而降了一位拥有白色翅膀的女性伊卡洛斯。自称是娱乐用万能天使的她，实际上却是拥有相当破坏力的战略兵器空之女王……在第1期的结尾，智树等人击退了刺客哈比后，回到和平的生活。而最近智树也开始习惯了有伊卡洛斯与宁芙在的热闹生活，原本以为不会再有什么大变化的日子中，智树却又再次梦到了之前看到的那个梦境，似乎又有什么事情将要发生……。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:59","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xbEAQBG5aa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JJudzTzQWb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sVdHEb8Jk31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8ps4ijfNch1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8kZYiikCzd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2GGd7zgiek1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/04MEHq12Kg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kyc46Qd39p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dzRaidL4sh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tPMcBeiVt21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zxbJr4BLKc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CAGXvm4bNW1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:52.426Z"}